  "description": {
    "en": "Package of activities addressed to read and write based on the tale \n<i>El peix irisat</i> by Marcus Pfister. The package has 3 parts: \n<ul> \n <li>The tale </li>\n <li>Learning with the tale. </li>\n <li>Learning with fishes. </li>\n</ul>",
